<title>ESTONIA: EESTI TELEFON 1996 NET PROFIT 139 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>EESTI TELEFON 1996 NET PROFIT 139 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Telefon said on Tuesday that its net profit was 139 million kroons in 1996 compared to 75.9 million kroons in 1995.</p>
<p>Eesti Telefon turnover was 990 million kroons in 1996, compared to 808 million kroons in 1995, a spokesperson told Reuters.</p>
</text>
